{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060031/block/singleImage/3247085/wm/01M5M6X8F4SHFND27P4S9B2AXG.jpeg?updatedAt=1792753596\"/><figcaption>井柏然以全球品牌大使身份到澳門出席活動。(娛樂組攝)</figcaption></figure><p>內地頂流男神井柏然近日憑《早春晴朗》再度爆紅，早前他赴澳門出席活動後，轉戰快閃香港。昨日，有網民捕獲井柏然現身尖沙咀 K11 MUSEA 行街購物，見他淡妝上陣，穿上米白色貼身上衣配牛仔褲，大晒 fit 爆身型，雖然打扮 casual ，但星味十足，並在商場內穿梭，相當吸睛。</p><p>除罩親民零架子 有幸運粉絲透露，當日井柏然原本戴着口罩行街，但其後相當識做，貼心地將口罩除低，並大方與粉絲零距離合照，表現相當親民。該粉絲更形容井柏然全程說話細聲溫柔，絲毫沒有明星架子，網民紛紛羨慕大呼：「太幸福了」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060031/block/singleImage/3247092/df/01M5M70J0QKP7E5TVJH90HGVNQ.jpeg?updatedAt=1792753596\"/><figcaption>粉絲透露井柏然說話細聲溫柔。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.975641+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:10.615031+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:02.507177+00:00","content_hash":"ebc4df11db0003f273f524ede7031c5631a6c64e0741538d1e2e388977157ee6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.975641+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}